---
import LetterShell from "../components/LetterShell.astro";
---

<LetterShell
  title="A Letter to Builders | Modern Faber"
  description="A letter for builders who care about shipped work, visible proof, and showing up every week."
  heroTitle="A Letter to Builders"
  meta={["For people who ship", "Read slowly"]}
  currentView="manifesto"
>
  <section class="doc-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="section-label">Manifesto</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="stanza">
        <span class="dropcap">M</span>ost groups talk.<br /><br />
        They share links.<br />
        They debate ideas.<br />
        They orbit around the idea of doing something meaningful.<br /><br />
        Nothing gets built.<br /><br />
        We are not that.
      </p>

      <div class="stanza-stack">
        <p class="stanza">We believe in a different standard.</p>
        <img class="stanza-art" src="/images/dither.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        <p class="stanza">
          Not intelligence as abstraction, but as execution.<br />
          Not taste as opinion, but as decisions made under constraint.<br />
          Not ambition as narrative, but as output&mdash;visible, undeniable, shipped.<br /><br />
          We care about what exists because you made it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="stanza">
        This is a room for people who build.<br /><br />
        People who obsess over details no one else notices.<br />
        Who rework something ten times when once would suffice.<br />
        Who feel discomfort when something is &ldquo;almost right.&rdquo;<br /><br />
        Craft is not a claim here.<br />
        It is evidence.
      </p>

      <p class="stanza">
        We are not interested in volume.<br /><br />
        We are interested in consistency.<br /><br />
        Showing up, every week, with something real.<br />
        Something you struggled through.<br />
        Something unfinished but undeniable.<br /><br />
        Not once.<br />
        Not occasionally.<br /><br />
        Every week.
      </p>

      <p class="stanza">
        This is not a place to consume.<br /><br />
        It is a place to produce.<br /><br />
        You will be seen through your work.<br />
        You will be challenged on your decisions.<br />
        You will be measured by what you do, not what you say.<br /><br />
        And in return&mdash;<br /><br />
        You will be surrounded by others doing the same.
      </p>

      <p class="stanza">
        There is no audience here.<br /><br />
        Only participants.<br /><br />
        If you are looking for validation, this will feel uncomfortable.<br />
        If you are looking for growth, it will feel inevitable.
      </p>

      <p class="stanza">
        Over time, something happens.<br /><br />
        A body of work emerges.<br />
        A standard sharpens.<br />
        A network forms&mdash;not through introductions, but through proof.<br /><br />
        A map gets drawn, one point at a time.
      </p>

      <p class="stanza">
        This is a simple system.<br /><br />
        Show up.<br />
        Build something real.<br />
        Do it again next week.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</LetterShell>
